WEBVTT

00:31:56.038 --> 00:32:00.621
for creative people of all sorts if
they're willing to expand their palette

00:32:00.621 --> 00:32:04.163
of possibilities. But with the
use of A.I. to be willing to.

00:32:04.163 --> 00:32:07.038
I mean, the one thing that the history
of technology has shown again

00:32:07.038 --> 00:32:12.913
and again is that something this powerful
and with this much benefit is unstoppable

00:32:13.163 --> 00:32:16.663
and you will get rewarded for embracing
it the most and the earliest.